# tests/qemu/swiftb.ndb: Swift on VectraOS, stage B (M6 step 6e3b, ADR-0034):
# swiftb, built by swift-on-vectra's tests/build.sh (EXTERNAL_PROGRAMS in
# build.c), runs async Swift across every core: a task group on the global
# executor's worker threads (one per usable CPU, over <threads.h>), an actor
# a hundred tasks update, Task.sleep to a deadline on ContinuousClock, a hop
# to the main actor, and Synchronization's Mutex on VectraOS's futexes.

scenario=swiftb timeout=60 cmdline=vx.skip=rc with=swiftb
expect="swiftb: hello from async Swift on VectraOS"
expect="swiftb: the group ran on "
expect="swiftb: slept "
expect=" checks, 0 failed"
line="svcd: swiftb exited"
fail="vx: panic"
fail="swiftb: FAILED"
fail="svcd: swiftb exited: "
